{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49389","headline":"虞美人 一 · 毛文锡","name":"虞美人 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸳鸯对浴银塘暖，水面蒲梢短。\n垂杨低拂麴尘波，蛛丝结网露珠多，滴圆荷。\n遥思桃叶吴江碧，便是天河隔。\n锦鳞红鬣影沈沈，想思空有梦相寻，意难任。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"毛文锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49389.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49389","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}